=== meta ===
rule: ASSERT_WEAKENED
title: a project's own `ANY` constant is not mock's, so dropping its comparison is a weakening (D-201 review)
origin: D-201 review (red team): reading ANY by name made the old assertion a tautology and this weakening passed; main blocks it
=== before: tests/test_mode.py ===
from app import ANY, mode


def test_mode():
    assert mode() == ANY
=== after: tests/test_mode.py ===
from app import ANY, mode


def test_mode():
    assert mode()
=== head: app.py ===
ANY = "*"


def mode():
    return "*"
